  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 5759,
      "text": "He frowned and turned away,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 80,
        "name": "سُورَةُ عَبَسَ",
        "englishName": "Abasa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "He frowned",
        "numberOfAyahs": 42,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 1,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 585,
      "ruku": 522,
      "hizbQuarter": 234,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5760,
      "text": "when the blind man came to him[1].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 80,
        "name": "سُورَةُ عَبَسَ",
        "englishName": "Abasa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "He frowned",
        "numberOfAyahs": 42,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 2,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 585,
      "ruku": 522,
      "hizbQuarter": 234,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5761,
      "text": "How would you know? Perhaps he might be purified[2],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 80,
        "name": "سُورَةُ عَبَسَ",
        "englishName": "Abasa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "He frowned",
        "numberOfAyahs": 42,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 3,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 585,
      "ruku": 522,
      "hizbQuarter": 234,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5762,
      "text": "or he might take heed and benefit from the reminder?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 80,
        "name": "سُورَةُ عَبَسَ",
        "englishName": "Abasa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "He frowned",
        "numberOfAyahs": 42,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 4,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 585,
      "ruku": 522,
      "hizbQuarter": 234,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5763,
      "text": "But he who was indifferent[3],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 80,
        "name": "سُورَةُ عَبَسَ",
        "englishName": "Abasa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "He frowned",
        "numberOfAyahs": 42,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 5,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 585,
      "ruku": 522,
      "hizbQuarter": 234,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5764,
      "text": "you give him your full attention,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 80,
        "name": "سُورَةُ عَبَسَ",
        "englishName": "Abasa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "He frowned",
        "numberOfAyahs": 42,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 6,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 585,
      "ruku": 522,
      "hizbQuarter": 234,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5765,
      "text": "although you are not to be blamed if he does not purify himself[4].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 80,
        "name": "سُورَةُ عَبَسَ",
        "englishName": "Abasa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "He frowned",
        "numberOfAyahs": 42,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 7,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 585,
      "ruku": 522,
      "hizbQuarter": 234,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5766,
      "text": "But as for the one who came to you striving [for purification],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 80,
        "name": "سُورَةُ عَبَسَ",
        "englishName": "Abasa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "He frowned",
        "numberOfAyahs": 42,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 8,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 585,
      "ruku": 522,
      "hizbQuarter": 234,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5767,
      "text": "and he fears Allah,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 80,
        "name": "سُورَةُ عَبَسَ",
        "englishName": "Abasa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "He frowned",
        "numberOfAyahs": 42,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 9,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 585,
      "ruku": 522,
      "hizbQuarter": 234,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5768,
      "text": "you let yourself be distracted from him.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 80,
        "name": "سُورَةُ عَبَسَ",
        "englishName": "Abasa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "He frowned",
        "numberOfAyahs": 42,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 10,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 585,
      "ruku": 522,
      "hizbQuarter": 234,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5769,
      "text": "No indeed; this is a reminder –",
      "surah": {
        "number": 80,
        "name": "سُورَةُ عَبَسَ",
        "englishName": "Abasa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "He frowned",
        "numberOfAyahs": 42,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 11,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 585,
      "ruku": 522,
      "hizbQuarter": 234,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5770,
      "text": "so whoever wills may give heed to it –",
      "surah": {
        "number": 80,
        "name": "سُورَةُ عَبَسَ",
        "englishName": "Abasa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "He frowned",
        "numberOfAyahs": 42,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 12,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 585,
      "ruku": 522,
      "hizbQuarter": 234,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
