      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 585,
      "ruku": 522,
      "hizbQuarter": 234,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5775,
      "text": "Woe to man; how ungrateful he is[5]!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 80,
        "name": "سُورَةُ عَبَسَ",
        "englishName": "Abasa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "He frowned",
        "numberOfAyahs": 42,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 17,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 585,
      "ruku": 522,
      "hizbQuarter": 234,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5776,
      "text": "From what did He create him?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 80,
        "name": "سُورَةُ عَبَسَ",
        "englishName": "Abasa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "He frowned",
        "numberOfAyahs": 42,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 18,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 585,
      "ruku": 522,
      "hizbQuarter": 234,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5777,
      "text": "He created him from a drop of semen and proportioned him[6],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 80,
        "name": "سُورَةُ عَبَسَ",
        "englishName": "Abasa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "He frowned",
        "numberOfAyahs": 42,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
